Subject: [PATCH v9 10/14] dma-buf: system_heap: Limit scatterlist entries to
 the buffer size
Date: Wed,  4 Nov 2026 22:15:51 +0530
Message-ID: <20261104164555.3555725-11-aneesh.kumar@kernel.org>
